Package: ClinicalTrialDesign
Type: Package
Title: Unified Interface for Clinical Trial Design
Version: 0.0.10.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Wei", family = "Fu", email = "wei.ai.lab@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Wei Fu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Wei Fu <wei.ai.lab@outlook.com>
Description: A consistent, well-documented R interface over established clinical
    trial design packages (gsDesign, gsDesign2, rpact, simtrial, and others),
    designed to be called from an MCP server so that LLM-based assistants can
    reliably produce correct designs. Supports fixed-sample, group-sequential,
    adaptive, multi-arm multi-stage, time-to-event, Bayesian, and master-
    protocol (platform/basket/umbrella) designs. Endpoints and methods cover
    both Phase 2 and Phase 3 confirmatory trials.
